% rebase('templates/skeleton.tpl', title=title)

<h1 class="mt-5">Training Completed</h1>

<p class="lead">
    You have completed the training session.
</p>

<p>
    The formal evaluation will now begin.
</p>

<p>
    Please continue to evaluate how well each generated caption represents
    the visual content of the video.
</p>

<p>
    Each video will appear four times during the evaluation, each time with a
    different generated caption. Please evaluate each video-caption pair
    independently in every trial.
</p>

<p>
    Please base your rating only on the visual content shown in the video.
</p>

<p>
    <a class="btn btn-large btn-success" href="/rate/0" id="next">
        Start Evaluation
    </a>
</p>